<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cantinho da Marina</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Great+Vibes&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    color:white;
    background:#000;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

.hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    position:relative;

    background:
    linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(0,0,0,.88) 0%,
        rgba(0,0,0,.72) 30%,
        rgba(0,0,0,.35) 55%,
        rgba(0,0,0,.08) 100%
    ),
    url('/static/home_marina.png');

    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center center;
    background-repeat:no-repeat;

    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
}

.content{
    width:100%;
    max-width:550px;
    margin-left:60px;
}

.logo{
    font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;
    font-size:82px;
    color:#ff76a0;
    line-height:1;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.sub{
    font-size:18px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);
    margin-bottom:35px;
}

.title{
    font-size:64px;
    line-height:1.05;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.desc{
    font-size:20px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);
    margin-bottom:35px;
}

.btn{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    text-align:center;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:20px;
    font-size:22px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4c7d,#ff85a8);
    color:white;
}

.btn-secondary{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    color:white;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
}

.features{
    margin-top:25px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
}

.feature{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:15px 18px;
    font-size:17px;
}

.secure{
    margin-top:25px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);
    font-size:14px;
}

@media(max-width:900px){

    .hero{
        align-items:flex-end;
        padding-bottom:30px;

        background:
        linear-gradient(
            to top,
            rgba(0,0,0,.95) 0%,
            rgba(0,0,0,.82) 40%,
            rgba(0,0,0,.20) 100%
        ),
        url('/static/home_marina.png');

        background-size:cover;
        background-position:center top;
    }

    .content{
        margin-left:0;
        padding:25px;
        max-width:100%;
    }

    .logo{
        font-size:58px;
    }

    .title{
        font-size:42px;
    }

    .desc{
        font-size:17px;
    }

    .btn{
        font-size:18px;
    }

    .feature{
        font-size:15px;
    }
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<div class="content">

<div class="logo">Marina</div>

<div class="sub">
Cantinho da Marina
</div>

<h1 class="title">
Bem-vindo ao<br>
meu cantinho
</h1>

<p class="desc">
Um lugar especial para me acompanhar mais de perto, conversar, ver meus conteúdos exclusivos e fazer parte da minha comunidade única.
</p>

<a href="/chat" class="btn btn-primary">
CRIAR MINHA CONTA
</a>

<a href="/chat" class="btn btn-secondary">
JÁ TENHO CONTA
</a>

<div class="features">

<div class="feature">
💬 Converse comigo
</div>

<div class="feature">
📸 Minhas fotos exclusivas
</div>

<div class="feature">
🎥 Meus vídeos exclusivos
</div>

<div class="feature">
❤️ Novidades em primeira mão
</div>

</div>

<div class="secure">
🔒 Ambiente seguro e privado
</div>

</div>

</section>

</body>
</html>